{"product_id":"ring-bearer-a-to-z","title":"Ring Bearer A to Z","description":"\u003cp\u003eColorful and trendy, Ring Bearer A to Z will make sure every young attendant will have fun learning about the special part he will play in the wedding. Written in rhyme, each letter of the alphabet ties in to a tradition or sentiment involving the upcoming wedding. There are full color photographs throughout plus a mirror on page 29. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Penelope Colville Paine \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780977476343 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44975797076121,"sku":"13RE9780977476343","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/d956ed03a5550fb915737a86d320f8ef.jpg?v=1732294683","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/ring-bearer-a-to-z","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}